# Alembic migrations (api-server)

Fresh installs still use `create_all` + `seed.py` on startup. Use Alembic when you need incremental schema changes in production.

```bash
cd services/api-server
export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://sigtrades:sigtrades@localhost:5432/sigtrades

# autogenerate from models (review before applying)
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

# apply
alembic upgrade head
```
